  - m_Id: 42
    m_Localized: Pause
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43
    m_Localized: "Technician L. Ramirez's Log \u2013 Day 3\r\nThe new security protocols
      are over the top. I don't understand why we need to check the servers every
      two hours. They say that \"certain digital entities\" have begun to exhibit
      unpredictable behavior patterns."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 44
    m_Localized: "Note from Guard H. Torres \u2013 Night Shift\r\nLast night I heard
      voices in the hallway, like someone was talking from the turned-off monitors.
      When I went closer, everything was silent. I'm not paid enough for this\u2026
      but I can't quit either. Nobody can."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 45
    m_Localized: "Dr. Vega's Report \u2013 Internal Record 12B\r\nThe subject assigned
      to the cognitive module showed an unusual increase in emotional activity. I
      don't know if it's a failure or progress, but the supervisors say that \"as
      long as he feels something, it works.\" I wish I knew exactly what that means."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 46
    m_Localized: "Personal Note from Engineer Solano \u2013 Server Area\nPlease check
      the memory system again and look for repeated fragments.\nIt's as if someone
      is rewriting their own memories without permission.\nIf this continues, the
      tests are going to get out of control."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47
    m_Localized: "Guard L. Mendez's Log \u2013 Shift Change\r\nI was assigned to
      patrol the Human Testing Level, but I haven't seen a single human. Just empty
      rooms, cameras on, and doors opening by themselves. I swear, sometimes I feel
      like someone's watching me from the panels."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48
    m_Localized: "Scientist E. Hoffman's Note \u2013 Day 14\r\nI was asked to ensure
      that the \"main subject\" doesn't detect any inconsistencies.\r\nHow am I supposed
      to do that if they don't even tell me what or who it is?\r\nThe only thing
      that's clear is that we must keep it stable\u2026 whatever it is."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49
    m_Localized: "Corporate Analyst Log \u2013 High Priority\r\nManagement has ordered
      all employees to avoid mentioning the word \u201Csimulation\u201D near active
      modules.\r\nIt sounds ridiculous, but the last time someone did, the sensors
      detected a massive anomaly. I still don't know what caused it."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50
    m_Localized: "Internal Memo from Supervisor Braga \u2013 Control Area\r\nThe
      cameras recorded activity in the hallways even though no personnel were assigned
      there. They said it could be a system error\u2026 but the patterns were moving
      as if they were real people. I don't like this at all. I feel like we're creating
      something we don't understand."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51
    m_Localized: get the cards
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52
    m_Localized: Reach the other portal
